# Company’s Webstack

## **Description**

This enrichment is powered by BuiltWith, a global leader in web technology profiling.

<img src="https://mintcdn.com/explorium/s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF/images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png?fit=max&auto=format&n=s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF&q=85&s=0657ccde913cf0ecd071e69eeef84f6c" alt="E7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb Image Pn" title="E7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb Image Pn" style={{ width:"41%" }} data-og-width="408" width="408" data-og-height="371" height="371" data-path="images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png" data-optimize="true" data-opv="3" srcset="https://mintcdn.com/explorium/s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF/images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png?w=280&fit=max&auto=format&n=s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF&q=85&s=74f781143afaa224d14e793f0a779f40 280w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF/images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png?w=560&fit=max&auto=format&n=s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF&q=85&s=c5372857d4e070cf4582eadc0f6dc576 560w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF/images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png?w=840&fit=max&auto=format&n=s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF&q=85&s=f32d46d2f37a32c5e58145f6c84c402b 840w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF/images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png?w=1100&fit=max&auto=format&n=s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF&q=85&s=453e3b86162e842b4b54e69ed891d3b0 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF/images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png?w=1650&fit=max&auto=format&n=s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF&q=85&s=cd5273f3de771e0f84bfe5e0e5d80ae5 1650w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF/images/reference/e7f63097ee189ed30f14a3555728ce8109a018eb886fc4551e1d6c2b62200bcb-image.png?w=2500&fit=max&auto=format&n=s1uRl5fGOrKpLiGF&q=85&s=9d3e63a3ab2b8ada65c0aa6f91411486 2500w" />

The **Webstack Enrichment** surfaces detailed insights about a company’s website infrastructure and technology usage. Powered by BuiltWith’s technology detection engine, this signal identifies the tools, platforms, and services a company uses on its public website, from eCommerce solutions and analytics to payment processors, security systems, and marketing tools.

These web signals help assess a company’s digital maturity, commercial intent, online investment, and trustworthiness. The enrichment supports use cases such as market segmentation, risk assessment, prospect prioritization, and competitive intelligence.

Each enrichment query returns a comprehensive profile of technologies in use, tech categories, spending estimates, Shopify integrations, traffic rankings, and more.

<AccordionGroup>
  <Accordion title="How It Works">
    * **Input:** Provide a `business_id` obtained from the **Match Businesses** API.
    * **Processing:** The system extracts the company’s domain, scans the website, and matches detected technologies via BuiltWith’s detection logic.
    * **Output:** A set of signals describing the website’s stack, activity, and structure.
  </Accordion>

  <Accordion title="Example Request (cURL)">
    ```bash Bash theme={null}
    {
      "request_context": {},
      "business_id": "a34bacf839b923770b2c360eefa26748"
    }
    ```
  </Accordion>

