  <Accordion title="Best Practices">
    * **`Always obtain thebusiness_id`** via the **Match Businesses** API before making company hierarchy enrichment requests.
    * **Leverage relationship data** to identify new business opportunities across connected entities.
    * **Cross-reference** with other enrichment APIs (e.g., Firmographics, Technographics) for deeper business context.
    * **Incorporate hierarchy analysis** into account planning for better coordination across business units.
  </Accordion>

  <Accordion title="Company Hierarchies Output Signals">
    | SignalAPI              | Name                        | Description                                                                   | Data Type     |
    | :--------------------- | :-------------------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :------------ |
    | input\_company\_id     | Input company ID            | The original business\_id provided as input                                   | EXPLORIUM\_ID |
    | input\_company\_name   | Input company name          | The name of the input company                                                 | COMPANY       |
    | parent\_company\_id    | Parent company ID           | Business ID of the immediate parent company                                   | EXPLORIUM\_ID |
    | parent\_company        | Parent company name         | The name of the immediate parent company                                      | COMPANY       |
    | ultimate\_parent\_id   | Ultimate parent ID          | Business ID of the top-most company in the tree (level\_0)                    | EXPLORIUM\_ID |
    | ultimate\_parent\_name | Ultimate parent name        | The name of the top-most company in the tree (level\_0)                       | COMPANY       |
    | subsidiaries           | Subsidiaries                | List of direct subsidiaries                                                   | JSON          |
    | org\_tree\_json        | Organization hierarchy Tree | A JSON structure representing the full organizational tree from top to bottom | JSON          |
  </Accordion>
</AccordionGroup>

