# Company’s Webstack (Bulk)

## **Description**

This enrichment is powered by BuiltWith, a global leader in web technology profiling.

<img src="https://mintcdn.com/explorium/ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM/images/download(1).png?fit=max&auto=format&n=ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM&q=85&s=e5da2e5cf31acf38d3cd191a52012649" alt="Download(1) Pn" title="Download(1) Pn" className="mr-auto" style={{ width:"20%" }} data-og-width="225" width="225" data-og-height="225" height="225" data-path="images/download(1).png" data-optimize="true" data-opv="3" srcset="https://mintcdn.com/explorium/ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM/images/download(1).png?w=280&fit=max&auto=format&n=ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM&q=85&s=4bb224f98701b050926aad690cb18176 280w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM/images/download(1).png?w=560&fit=max&auto=format&n=ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM&q=85&s=ddca08aa52f7aab2ef1564a76d671f65 560w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM/images/download(1).png?w=840&fit=max&auto=format&n=ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM&q=85&s=417df26bd52a2a72620889f5dde0d5b4 840w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM/images/download(1).png?w=1100&fit=max&auto=format&n=ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM&q=85&s=cbf9cd83c3a4d683012cfff718f722e1 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM/images/download(1).png?w=1650&fit=max&auto=format&n=ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM&q=85&s=88a15ced9f39402e8e1bada6b258d290 1650w, https://mintcdn.com/explorium/ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM/images/download(1).png?w=2500&fit=max&auto=format&n=ZHii_FJbF62xxWTM&q=85&s=41c5d33a7b2be66420136bf8d8a11b7d 2500w" />

The **Webstack Enrichment** surfaces detailed insights about a company’s website infrastructure and technology usage. Powered by BuiltWith’s technology detection engine, this signal identifies the tools, platforms, and services a company uses on its public website, from eCommerce solutions and analytics to payment processors, security systems, and marketing tools.

These web signals help assess a company’s digital maturity, commercial intent, online investment, and trustworthiness. The enrichment supports use cases such as market segmentation, risk assessment, prospect prioritization, and competitive intelligence.

Each enrichment query returns a comprehensive profile of technologies in use, tech categories, spending estimates, Shopify integrations, traffic rankings, and more.

<AccordionGroup>
  <Accordion title="How It Works">
    * **Input:** Provide a `business_id` obtained from the **Match Businesses** API.
    * **Processing:** The system extracts the company’s domain, scans the website, and matches detected technologies via BuiltWith’s detection logic.
    * **Output:** A set of signals describing the website’s stack, activity, and structure.
  </Accordion>

  <Accordion title="Example Request (cURL)">
    ```bash Bash theme={null}
    {
      "request_context": {},
      "business_ids": ["a34bacf839b923770b2c360eefa26748"]
    }
    ```
  </Accordion>

